So we'll talk about that just in just a second.

00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:06,860
And then functional tests.

00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:12,940
So before we were really a specific cancer clinic for years, we did a lot of functional

00:09:12,940 --> 00:09:18,820
tests, different nutrient tests, different what's called an oat test, which is an organic

00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:25,060
acid test, mold test, parasite stool test, I mean, there's literally dozens and dozens

