and dozens of different functional tests that you can test for, and you can spend a lot

00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:35,660
of money on different tests, and they can give us different data.

00:09:35,660 --> 00:09:43,340
Specific to the cancer, not really specific to the cancer, but certainly if you have mold

00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:50,100
issues or parasite issues and different things, it's going to hinder your body's immune response

00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:52,340
to be able to kill the cancer.

00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:57,740
But many times, the reason why we don't do a lot of functional tests with our cancer patient

00:09:57,740 --> 00:10:04,300
is that many times our cancer patients are taking care of themselves because of the cancer.

00:10:04,300 --> 00:10:11,300
Better than we could ever have gotten our sick patients, our autoimmune patients years

00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:17,500
past, even doing an oat test in a mold test, a parasite, getting them motivated to follow

00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:19,340
their diet and such.

00:10:19,340 --> 00:10:21,260
That still wasn't enough.

00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:27,100
So most of our cancer patients are following a strict, regimented good nutrition and specific

00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:32,420
nutrients that will be addressing a lot of those things anyhow.

00:10:32,420 --> 00:10:36,060
So if a person came to us and said, I just got diagnosed with cancer and I want to do all

00:10:36,060 --> 00:10:38,900
these labs, well, certainly we can.

00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:43,780
It does get expensive to do all those labs, but it certainly can be done.

00:10:43,780 --> 00:10:45,820
We can do food sensitivity testing.

00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:51,260
We can do different side rec antibody tests and there's a whole bunch of stuff that I love

00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,260
to do.

00:10:52,260 --> 00:10:53,260
They're fun to look at.

